    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We are now holding a Kickstarter campaign lasting till 14th June! If you would like to support, kindly search &quot;Stand By Me Kickstarter&quot; on your search engine! Thank you &lt;3</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an RPG-visual novel hybrid, our game offers the best of both worlds \u2014 the rich storytelling and art of a visual novel, and the ability to interact with your environment and the people around you like in RPG games.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of Ciel Rozenbleu to explore Una's three countries \u2014 Desideria, Cantara and Idris!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in a choice-based battle system which takes you through exciting combat scenes featuring full-color comic strips!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve headfirst into this fantasy world and watch the action, politics, and romance unfold!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/586d54284ab05c3ee87eabff37d52830.avif?t=1754152976\" data-has-big width=800 height=185 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>After a deadly accident, you wake up in the unfamiliar land of Desideria, assuming the equally unfamiliar identity of Ciel Rozenbleu - a sorceress in the royal military.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It\u2019s your life now. A new path will be carved by your hands.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Stand by Me is set in\u00a0the\u00a0<strong>Una Continent</strong> which is made up of three countries:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Desideria</strong>, a powerful empire where magic reigns supreme.\u00a0 Their current goal is to conquer Idris and unite the continent of Una.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cantara</strong>, a Desiderian colony that lacks magical expertise but specialises in technology.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idris</strong>, a hunter-gatherer civilisation that possesses a powerful form of magic that manipulates one's\u00a0life force\u2014Priroda.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in a unfamiliar world and with no way to get home, you stumble about trying to play the part of Ciel Rozenbleu.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you\u2019re not Ciel. You\u2019re a modern misfit in this archaic fantasy world, and you have your own opinions.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you stand firm in your beliefs, or will you rethink your allegiances?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who will you choose to stand by?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/4db6cff2f51888078c60fb747bb36e72.avif?t=1754152976\" data-has-big width=800 height=221 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the world of Stand By Me and\u00a0<strong>explore 40+ maps\u00a0</strong>that span across Desideria, Cantara, and Idris.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/a95d0b28e2a39d7a5fbc4fdf6472b463.poster.avif?t=1754152976\" width=506 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/a95d0b28e2a39d7a5fbc4fdf6472b463.webm?t=1754152976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/a95d0b28e2a39d7a5fbc4fdf6472b463.mp4?t=1754152976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in a<strong>\u00a0choice-based battle system</strong>\u00a0which takes you through exciting combat scenes featuring dynamic comic strips!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/ef6f2eab35ac9d77ad7ab4a2dd6f6695.poster.avif?t=1754152976\" width=550 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/ef6f2eab35ac9d77ad7ab4a2dd6f6695.webm?t=1754152976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/ef6f2eab35ac9d77ad7ab4a2dd6f6695.mp4?t=1754152976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy\u00a0<strong>full-colour character graphics and pixel art</strong>\u00a0for both main and side characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/96d68a591876bfeacf77c701a5129e62.poster.avif?t=1754152976\" width=548 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/96d68a591876bfeacf77c701a5129e62.webm?t=1754152976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/96d68a591876bfeacf77c701a5129e62.mp4?t=1754152976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Social Stats System:\u00a0</strong>Interact with the characters around you or do well in battles and you might just learn a thing or two - your progress from an ignorant knucklehead to a wise, powerful sorceress starts here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/b424501ec19bf562ad141a8bdcb40146.avif?t=1754152976\" data-has-big width=800 height=614 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choices you make matter, and can affect your relationships with the 5 love interests. Check the\u00a0<strong>affection menu</strong>\u00a0to see where you stand.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/9e0a90710ef8814e01ea70eba3b3f695.poster.avif?t=1754152976\" width=546 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/9e0a90710ef8814e01ea70eba3b3f695.webm?t=1754152976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/9e0a90710ef8814e01ea70eba3b3f695.mp4?t=1754152976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/30815cacaf573e7aa66867e0f4bb4de5.avif?t=1754152976\" data-has-big width=800 height=187 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/c93dce2078be9d0da20c5ad010150b23.avif?t=1754152976\" data-has-big width=800 height=564 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/efabb6933249eb4dfa7d83e2b3e40ea5.avif?t=1754152976\" data-has-big width=800 height=564 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/c87341bca49a18fae49b092b7d929fde.avif?t=1754152976\" data-has-big width=800 height=564 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/903fc17ee9a937e255d6dce3d9174349.avif?t=1754152976\" data-has-big width=800 height=564 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/6c966000b7fca07578d025295b2bd366.avif?t=1754152976\" data-has-big width=800 height=564 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/9d2913244cd0d856c22130080b4f88c4.avif?t=1754152976\" data-has-big width=800 height=564 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/1e67c3edf1988ba69aff3ed0ffd2b1ae.avif?t=1754152976\" data-has-big width=800 height=149 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/a7eb1be8197361b81936e24c3bc4cef0.avif?t=1754152976\" data-has-big width=800 height=533 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/1740108530a302b2999f3e876307ca95.avif?t=1754152976\" width=800 height=760 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd0d Special Thanks:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stand By Me PV: sense_aep</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game studio logo: IUM</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Una Map: SirenSongBoutique</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PV Music: Yoshinori Tanaka</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/21ebbf465fbdadb1cf97f99491a04e3e.webp?t=1754152976\" width=312 height=62 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We are now holding a Kickstarter campaign lasting till 14th June! If you would like to support, kindly search &quot;Stand By Me Kickstarter&quot; on your search engine! Thank you &lt;3</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an RPG-visual novel hybrid, our game offers the best of both worlds \u2014 the rich storytelling and art of a visual novel, and the ability to interact with your environment and the people around you like in RPG games.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of Ciel Rozenbleu to explore Una's three countries \u2014 Desideria, Cantara and Idris!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in a choice-based battle system which takes you through exciting combat scenes featuring full-color comic strips!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve headfirst into this fantasy world and watch the action, politics, and romance unfold!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/586d54284ab05c3ee87eabff37d52830.avif?t=1754152976\" data-has-big width=800 height=185 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>After a deadly accident, you wake up in the unfamiliar land of Desideria, assuming the equally unfamiliar identity of Ciel Rozenbleu - a sorceress in the royal military.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It\u2019s your life now. A new path will be carved by your hands.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Stand by Me is set in\u00a0the\u00a0<strong>Una Continent</strong> which is made up of three countries:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Desideria</strong>, a powerful empire where magic reigns supreme.\u00a0 Their current goal is to conquer Idris and unite the continent of Una.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cantara</strong>, a Desiderian colony that lacks magical expertise but specialises in technology.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idris</strong>, a hunter-gatherer civilisation that possesses a powerful form of magic that manipulates one's\u00a0life force\u2014Priroda.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in a unfamiliar world and with no way to get home, you stumble about trying to play the part of Ciel Rozenbleu.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you\u2019re not Ciel. You\u2019re a modern misfit in this archaic fantasy world, and you have your own opinions.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you stand firm in your beliefs, or will you rethink your allegiances?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who will you choose to stand by?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/4db6cff2f51888078c60fb747bb36e72.avif?t=1754152976\" data-has-big width=800 height=221 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the world of Stand By Me and\u00a0<strong>explore 40+ maps\u00a0</strong>that span across Desideria, Cantara, and Idris.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/a95d0b28e2a39d7a5fbc4fdf6472b463.poster.avif?t=1754152976\" width=506 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/a95d0b28e2a39d7a5fbc4fdf6472b463.webm?t=1754152976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/a95d0b28e2a39d7a5fbc4fdf6472b463.mp4?t=1754152976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in a<strong>\u00a0choice-based battle system</strong>\u00a0which takes you through exciting combat scenes featuring dynamic comic strips!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/ef6f2eab35ac9d77ad7ab4a2dd6f6695.poster.avif?t=1754152976\" width=550 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/ef6f2eab35ac9d77ad7ab4a2dd6f6695.webm?t=1754152976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/ef6f2eab35ac9d77ad7ab4a2dd6f6695.mp4?t=1754152976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy\u00a0<strong>full-colour character graphics and pixel art</strong>\u00a0for both main and side characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/96d68a591876bfeacf77c701a5129e62.poster.avif?t=1754152976\" width=548 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/96d68a591876bfeacf77c701a5129e62.webm?t=1754152976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/96d68a591876bfeacf77c701a5129e62.mp4?t=1754152976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Social Stats System:\u00a0</strong>Interact with the characters around you or do well in battles and you might just learn a thing or two - your progress from an ignorant knucklehead to a wise, powerful sorceress starts here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/b424501ec19bf562ad141a8bdcb40146.avif?t=1754152976\" data-has-big width=800 height=614 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choices you make matter, and can affect your relationships with the 5 love interests. Check the\u00a0<strong>affection menu</strong>\u00a0to see where you stand.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/9e0a90710ef8814e01ea70eba3b3f695.poster.avif?t=1754152976\" width=546 height=418 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/9e0a90710ef8814e01ea70eba3b3f695.webm?t=1754152976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/9e0a90710ef8814e01ea70eba3b3f695.mp4?t=1754152976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/30815cacaf573e7aa66867e0f4bb4de5.avif?t=1754152976\" data-has-big width=800 height=187 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/c93dce2078be9d0da20c5ad010150b23.avif?t=1754152976\" data-has-big width=800 height=564 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/efabb6933249eb4dfa7d83e2b3e40ea5.avif?t=1754152976\" data-has-big width=800 height=564 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/c87341bca49a18fae49b092b7d929fde.avif?t=1754152976\" data-has-big width=800 height=564 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/903fc17ee9a937e255d6dce3d9174349.avif?t=1754152976\" data-has-big width=800 height=564 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/6c966000b7fca07578d025295b2bd366.avif?t=1754152976\" data-has-big width=800 height=564 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/9d2913244cd0d856c22130080b4f88c4.avif?t=1754152976\" data-has-big width=800 height=564 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/1e67c3edf1988ba69aff3ed0ffd2b1ae.avif?t=1754152976\" data-has-big width=800 height=149 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/a7eb1be8197361b81936e24c3bc4cef0.avif?t=1754152976\" data-has-big width=800 height=533 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/1740108530a302b2999f3e876307ca95.avif?t=1754152976\" width=800 height=760 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd0d Special Thanks:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stand By Me PV: sense_aep</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game studio logo: IUM</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Una Map: SirenSongBoutique</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PV Music: Yoshin